Brand sample captions in brand voice
title end

paragraph start
A sample caption shows the voice in use. Each sample follows one shape: a hook line, one useful sentence and one call to action, written in the chosen traits.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Samples are written only after the voice traits exist, then checked against the words lists. Each sample is labelled with its situation and face.
paragraph end

